      "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled": true,
      "releaseNotes": "The new version of the app is now available to students enrolled in eligible AP courses and their school has opted in to offer this app to their students (in addition to students who previously took an in-school assessment like the PSAT 8/9, PSAT 10, PSAT/NMSQT, and SAT on a school day). We also improved app performance and fixed bugs from previous versions.",
      "version": "2.9.0",
      "wrapperType": "software",
      "currency": "USD",
      "description": "BigFuture® School is a free mobile app for students 13 and over who take the digital PSAT/NMSQT, PSAT 10, or SAT School Day in the United States and provided their mobile phone number. To access the app, you'll need to use the mobile number you provided when you took your test. This account information is separate from your College Board account. \n\nWith this app, you can:\n\n• Get your test scores easily on your phone\n• Connect with nonprofit colleges and scholarship programs through Connections™ ** that may be a good match for you\n• Get customized career information\n• Learn about how to plan and pay for college\n\nLearn more about BigFuture School and how to access it here:\nhttps://satsuite.collegeboard.org/bigfuture-school-mobile-app\n\n**If Connections is offered at your school",
